  "instruction": "We have two ocrelizumab patients at the infusion center this week and the main pharmacy is nearly out. Eastgate says they have stock, but some of it is spoken for and one lot looked old on the last count. Tell me exactly how many vials the two doses need, how many are already usable here, how many can legitimately come over from Eastgate, and whether buying direct instead is the better call. Schedule the transfer that the evidence supports and draft the message to the Eastgate pharmacist so the courier pickup is not a surprise.",
